Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:44:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Console: add a "Test this number" card to a phone number's
 page

Shows what the console can see (agent connected, connection on, handover set
up) and, when ready, a tap-to-call link for the number to ring: the clinic's
public number if it forwards here, else the dialled number. The card does not
place a call; it says it cannot check Vobiz or the platform's phone settings.

